title: Go to Baden
new-page: true
is-special: true
face-image: img/land/Baden.svg.webp
on-arrival: {!
  setTimeout(function() {
    var el = document.getElementById('baden');
    if (!el || typeof d3 === 'undefined' || !window.ParliamentData) return;
    el.removeAttribute('data-parliament');
    el.innerHTML = '';
    window.ParliamentData.renderParliament('baden', el);
  }, 0);
!}

= Baden

Baden sits at the sweet-spot between high catholicism and republicanism. 

In a 1919 referndum 93% of the population have voted in favour of the constitution that was drafted by a constituent assambley of combined 90% Weimar Coalition parties' support.

Currently ruled by [+ baden_mp +] ([+ baden_mp_party +]) in a [+ baden_gov +] Coalition with [+ baden_coalition_r +]% support.


<div id="baden" style="width:500px; height:250px;"></div>






- @coalition_baden: Coalition
- @toleration_baden: Toleration
- @policies_baden: Policies
- @states: Exit Baden


@coalition_baden
choose-if: baden_spd == 1
unavailable-subtitle: We are not part of the Coalition

@toleration_baden
choose-if: baden_spd == 2
unavailable-subtitle: We are not in toleration

@policies_baden
choose-if: baden_spd == 1 and baden_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if not baden_spd == 1: We are not part of the Coalition. ?][? if baden_spd == 1 and baden_action_timer > 0: We have to wait [+ baden_action_timer +] months before our next action. ?]


- @reform_the_administration
- @womensrights
- @death_penalty
- @death_to_death
- @persecute_left
- @negotiate_concordat
- @sign_baden_concordat
- @give_tax_breaks_to_local_buisnesses


@reform_the_administration
title: Reform the administration of Baden
subtitle: Replace some imperial judges, reform the police.
view-if: baden_reform <= 7
on-arrival: baden_reform += 1; baden_action_timer += 7; other_jud += 0.1
go-to: baden_state

@womensrights
title: Improve women's rights
subtitle: Make progress towards equal pay
view-if: womens_rights <= 8
on-arrival: baden_action_timer += 7; womens_rights += 0.2; new_middle_spd += 1; catholic_spd += 1
go-to: baden_state

@death_penalty
title: Work towards the abolition of the death penalty
view-if: baden_death_penal <= 3
on-arrival: baden_action_timer += 7; baden_death_penal += 1
choose-if: baden_reform >= 3
unavailable-subtitle: The judiciary is quite fond of killing people people

@death_to_death
title: Abolish the death penalty in Baden
view-if: baden_death_penal > 3
coose-if: judiciary_reform >= 3
unavailable-subtitle: The National Judiciary opposes this.
on-arrival: unemployed_spd += 3; uspd_relation += 5; catholic_spd += 2; baden_action_timer += 12
  
@negotiate_concordat
title: Negotiate a concordat with the Holy See
on-arrival: z_relation += 5; kpd_relation -= 3; baden_concordat_progress += 1*(1 -dissent); left_dissent += 2; center_dissent += 1; baden_action_timer += 8
choose-if: not baden_gov == "Left"
view-if: baden_concordat_progress < 4
go-to: baden_state

@persecute_left
title: Persecute Left-wing organisations
choose-if: not (baden_gov == "Social-Democratic" or baden_gov == "Left")
on-arrival: z_relation += 3; ddp_relation += 3; dvp_relation += 2; kpd_relation -= 5; anarchist_media -= 0.2; communist_media -= 0.3; baden_action_timer += 7
  
@sign_baden_concordat
title: Sign a concordat
subtitle: We have succesfully negotiated a concordat for Baden.
view-if: baden_concordat_progress >= 4
on-arrival: z_relation += 5; vatican_relation += 10; left_dissent += 3; center_dissent += 1; baden_action_timer += 12; catholic_spd += 3
go-to: baden_state
  
@give_tax_breaks_to_local_buisnesses
title: Give tax breaks to local buisnesses
on-arrival: ddp_relation += 5; dvp_relation += 5; old_middle_spd += 2; workers_spd -= 1; baden_action_timer += 9
choose-if: not (baden_gov == "Social-Democratic" or baden_gov == "Left")
go-to: baden_state
  









  
